  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "下hng暗ê台北"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>里&nbsp; &nbsp; 仔</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">下hng暗ê台北</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無張無持</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">比íng擺吵鬧--一-寡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">明明</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">電車起行前ê鈴聲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kah進前tân了仝款緊急</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">仝款尖尖ē ui耳膜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雖bóng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">忠孝東路頂tsông--過ê thoo-lá-khuh、bá-suh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ia̋n-jín ê háu-huah仝款驚--人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tńg-uat ê角度仝款大膽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就算</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">地下街四箍liàn-tńg ê人人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">跤步kah別時仝款恬靜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">面頂ê表情仝款豐富</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">下hng暗ê台北</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Iáu是比平常時鬧熱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">原來是因為</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī立法院</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī應該是台灣人ê立法院</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人ê權利</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">應該是台灣人ê權利</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tng-leh hōo一隻蟲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一隻無應當踮tsia ê外來種</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">軟塗深掘　一喙一喙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">慢慢仔偷食--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">所以</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有一隻鳥</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一隻百分之百在來ê青鳥</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Thián翼飛到蟲ê巢窟</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">用下hng暗十萬外人ê聲音</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">用80冬tsiūnn千萬人ê厭氣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">譜做響透台北ê歌</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo蟲仔知影</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit phiàn土地、tsit phiàn天</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是啥人--ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">可惜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鳥仔iáu m̄ bat</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蟲m̄是人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">外來種無leh講理</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若beh平靜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ài先kā歌tsiânn做聲ê湧</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ián hōo倒</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">用鳥仔喙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啄hōo thàng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規隻吞腹內</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">下hng暗ê台北</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">比íng擺吵鬧--一-寡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">望以後ê台灣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄免koh hiah-nī鬧熱</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgqpkZaJO5Trep_3XMRZ-2t11HliAcCg8lu7A9xYkcrEV7Nyl5uTysA55Y_5SattKJ1_bszu3fhEiFZJPZ5cAFyylrcKex8Fik6MBBCliZbTHHBIYNjQ7XaLzzxQY81nWDdFyDNr0mMqCfmO_uihfLIthdN0G2-HdOw5o8SLdXm93tHDaHXO7-4eFextGXB/s30